    "created_at": "2026-10-15T19:59:20Z",
    "display_title": "chore(ci): the pre-commit hook runs only the staged test suites",
    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "chore/pre-commit-staged-tests-only",
    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): the pre-commit hook runs only the staged test suites\n\nThe run-tests hook ran the whole gdUnit4 suite on every commit, docs-only\nones included, against CLAUDE.md's \"CI is the test runner\". On 2026-10-15\nit hung a docs-only commit for over an hour.\n\nThe hook now fires only when files under tests/ are staged and runs just the\nstaged test_*.gd suites (staged_tests.py, with its tests). run_tests.sh with\nno arguments still runs the full suite by hand. The README notes that a\nstale class cache after a pull needs one --import pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "head_sha": "e40f504755df0e0ec2fa759dd7e5dac9f5987edf",
